OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of crime death teenagers
OL,4,Acall for knife crackdown and tougher
OL,5,Asentences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe families of two murdered teenagers
OL,8,Fare demanding tougher sentences on
OL,9,Fknife crime and stricter monitoring of
OL,10,Fkillers who have been released from
OL,11,Fprison.
OL,13,FPaul Moy, whose son Kayden was stabbed
OL,14,Fto death last year, has joined forces
OL,15,Fwith Lisa Stewart, whose sister
OL,16,FMichelle was killed by her ex-boyfriend
OL,17,Fin 2008.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
