OL,3,GNEWSAFamilies of crime death teenagers
OL,4,Acall for knife crackdown and tougher
OL,5,Asentences
OL,6,
OL,7,FThey were supported by Stewart
OL,8,FHandling, whose daughter Grace died at
OL,9,Fthe age of 13 after taking ecstasy
OL,10,Ftablets, during a meeting with Justice
OL,11,FSecretary Neil Gray at the Scottish
OL,12,FParliament.
OL,14,FGray later thanked the families for
OL,15,Ftheir contribution, and said some new
OL,16,Fmeasures such as GPS monitoring were
OL,17,Fbeing looked at.
